* Jingle bells, jingle bells, jingle all the way *

348
00:15:52,250 --> 00:15:53,980
* 我们滑雪多快乐 *
* Oh, what fun it is to ride *

349
00:15:53,980 --> 00:15:56,470
* 我们坐在雪橇上 *
* in a one-horse open sleigh, hey! *

350
00:15:58,900 --> 00:16:01,520
艾米  这果干布丁真好吃
Amy, that pudding was delicious.

351
00:16:01,520 --> 00:16:03,890
如果你喜欢葡萄干的话
If you like raisins.

352
00:16:04,600 --> 00:16:06,620
多谢  我放的是无花果干
Thank you. And it's figs.

353
00:16:07,840 --> 00:16:09,590
如果是这样  那就变得"超美味"呢
Oh, in that case, it was pretty good.

354
00:16:11,010 --> 00:16:13,410
你还好吧  你都没怎么吃鹅肉
You feeling okay? You hardly touched your goose.

355
00:16:13,410 --> 00:16:16,200
闻起来太像冠蓝鸦了
It smelled too much like blue jay.

356
00:16:16,820 --> 00:16:18,110
我帮你收拾吧
Can I help you clean up?

357
00:16:18,110 --> 00:16:19,970
你用海姆力克法帮我咳出了羊毛球
Oh, you Heimliched a ball of wool out of me;

358
00:16:19,970 --> 00:16:21,210
就不麻烦你了
you're good.

359
00:16:23,190 --> 00:16:25,200
我们开始交换礼物吧
Uh, what do you say we exchange gifts?

360
00:16:25,200 --> 00:16:26,630
谢尔顿  我们没带礼物啊
Oh, Sheldon, we didn't bring any.

361
00:16:26,630 --> 00:16:28,160
我以为你讨厌交换礼物呢
I thought you hate giving gifts.

362
00:16:28,160 --> 00:16:29,050
我是讨厌
Yeah, I do.

363
00:16:29,050 --> 00:16:32,620
所以我才给艾米带了这个
Which is why I got Amy this.

364
00:16:32,620 --> 00:16:34,410
你给我带了礼物吗
You got me something?

365
00:16:34,410 --> 00:16:35,830
不  不止是礼物
Oh, not just something, no.

366
00:16:35,830 --> 00:16:38,580
我这是用心挑选的  节日主题的
It's from the heart, it's holiday-themed,

367
00:16:38,580 --> 00:16:42,910
收据被我吃了  所以你也没法退了
and I swallowed the gift receipt so you cannot return it.

368
00:16:46,090 --> 00:16:48,620
看看你坐在圣诞老人腿上的样子
Look at you on Santa's lap.

369
00:16:48,620 --> 00:16:49,970
真是太可爱了
That's so sweet.

370
00:16:49,970 --> 00:16:53,090
那当然  这礼物可完美呢
Of course it is. It's the perfect gift.

371
00:16:53,090 --> 00:16:54,760
你现在有什么感想
H-How are you feeling right now?

372
00:16:54,760 --> 00:16:57,340
是否有罪恶感  悲哀感
Guilty? Sad?

373
00:16:57,340 --> 00:16:59,160
宁愿自己是不过圣诞的犹太人吗
Wishing you were Jewish?

374
00:17:00,760 --> 00:17:02,380
不  我非常喜欢
No, I love it.

375
00:17:02,380 --> 00:17:03,660
真的吗
Oh, really?

376
00:17:03,660 --> 00:17:05,510
那这个怎么样呢
Well, how about now?

377
00:17:06,890 --> 00:17:11,170
我亲爱的艾米  节日快乐
Happy holidays to my dear Amy.

378
00:17:11,170 --> 00:17:13,470
我希望你能珍惜这份礼物
I hope you treasure this

379
00:17:13,470 --> 00:17:16,950
像我珍惜你那样
as much as I treasure you.

380
00:17:18,220 --> 00:17:20,930
但是你都没为我准备礼物
And you got me nothing.

381
00:17:21,530 --> 00:17:23,130
圣诞节被你毁了
Christmas is ruined.

382
00:17:23,130 --> 00:17:25,790
我们再也不要提这件事了
Let's never speak of it again.

383
00:17:25,790 --> 00:17:28,250
哇  这还真好玩
Well, this was fun.

384
00:17:29,010 --> 00:17:30,320
其实呢
Actually,

385
00:17:30,750 --> 00:17:33,130
我为你准备了一份礼物
I did get you something.

386
00:17:33,750 --> 00:17:35,520
我们不是有协议吗
But what about our agreement?

387
00:17:35,520 --> 00:17:38,480
可你也送了我礼物啊  给你
Well, you got me something. Here.

388
00:17:42,440 --> 00:17:44,350
饼干吗
Cookies?

389
00:17:44,750 --> 00:17:47,550
是你外婆的圣诞饼干哦
They're your Meemaw's Christmas cookies.

390
00:17:47,550 --> 00:17:50,290
我给她打电话要了配方
I called and got the recipe.

391
00:17:59,520 --> 00:18:01,970
这些饼干太好吃了
They're perfect.

392
00:18:02,990 --> 00:18:05,110
和她的拥抱一样美好
It tastes like her hugs.

393
00:18:07,730 --> 00:18:10,420
圣诞快乐  谢尔顿
Merry Christmas, Sheldon.

394
00:18:10,860 --> 00:18:13,250
我真不敢相信
I can't believe this.

395
00:18:13,250 --> 00:18:17,180
你开心  我也开心
You're happy, I'm happy.

396
00:18:17,180 --> 00:18:19,630
也许一个强调馈赠的节日并不是那么...
Well, maybe a holiday that's all about giving isn't so...

397
00:18:19,630 --> 00:18:21,550
拿开你的脏爪
Get your hand out of that box!

398
00:18:26,690 --> 00:18:27,740
好了
Okay.

399
00:18:27,740 --> 00:18:32,010
下一个游戏叫做寻找热豆豆
The next game is called Hot Boiled Beans.

400
00:18:33,310 --> 00:18:35,060
我猜也是
Of course it is.

401
00:18:35,930 --> 00:18:37,910
选一个人离开房间
One person is sent out of the room

402
00:18:37,910 --> 00:18:40,580
其他人留在里面藏起一个小玩意
while the others hide a small item.

403
00:18:40,580 --> 00:18:43,750
然后对外面的人说
Then they invite the first person back by saying,

404
00:18:43,750 --> 00:18:45,770
"晚餐已煮好  热豆加培根
"Hot boiled beans and bacon for supper,

405
00:18:45,770 --> 00:18:48,570
快快进屋里  趁热找到它"
hurry up before it gets cold."

406
00:18:52,020 --> 00:18:54,550
如果你们觉得这比汤姆·汉克斯感恩节好玩
If you people think this is better than Tom Hanks-giving,

407
00:18:54,550 --> 00:18:56,620
我也是醉了
you're all crazy.

